{"4304800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slash-Out: Fantasy Dueling", "steam_appid": 4304800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash-Out is a twin-stick fighting game featuring sword-fighting action against a gauntlet of boss battles. Prove yourself by mastering both the Sword and Shield to save the kingdom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom is in danger. An ancient evil is rising, and the people are powerless to stop it. But in a far corner of the land, a flicker of hope glimmers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up sword and shield and journey across the land to vanquish evil. On your quest you will encounter many foes who wish to stop you. Face them in honourable combat! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L2 - Raise Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 - Shield Bash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Stick / D-Pad - Move Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Stick / Face Buttons - Slash Sword</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/b16c4525b6b00ec9d6593c2fd4ceb3ff.avif?t=1784303303\" width=564 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also playable on Keyboard</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be On Your Guard!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the Left Stick, move your shield to successfully block enemy attacks. Block enough and get an opening to attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash Away!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick the Right Stick to slash your sword. The direction you flick the stick in will change the angle of your attack. Attack in patterns to execute combos for extra damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gauntlet of Non-Stop Boss Battles</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No filler, just duel after duel against a cadre of fantasy opponents. Each has their own strategies and tricks. It will take both dexterity and guile to best them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO AI USED. MADE BY 100% FLESH AND BLOOD.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash-Out is a twin-stick fighting game featuring sword-fighting action against a gauntlet of boss battles. Prove yourself by mastering both the Sword and Shield to save the kingdom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom is in danger. An ancient evil is rising, and the people are powerless to stop it. But in a far corner of the land, a flicker of hope glimmers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up sword and shield and journey across the land to vanquish evil. On your quest you will encounter many foes who wish to stop you. Face them in honourable combat! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L2 - Raise Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 - Shield Bash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Stick / D-Pad - Move Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Stick / Face Buttons - Slash Sword</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/b16c4525b6b00ec9d6593c2fd4ceb3ff.avif?t=1784303303\" width=564 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also playable on Keyboard</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be On Your Guard!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/d282c108510cb496ca11686451ff5ad1.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the Left Stick, move your shield to successfully block enemy attacks. Block enough and get an opening to attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash Away!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/00ba274cb15eac761cf1ed7b0031eee6.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick the Right Stick to slash your sword. The direction you flick the stick in will change the angle of your attack. Attack in patterns to execute combos for extra damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gauntlet of Non-Stop Boss Battles</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.poster.avif?t=1784303303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.webm?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/extras/31707e002e3eae322320403678171d64.mp4?t=1784303303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No filler, just duel after duel against a cadre of fantasy opponents. Each has their own strategies and tricks. It will take both dexterity and guile to best them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO AI USED. MADE BY 100% FLESH AND BLOOD.</h2>", "short_description": "In Slash-Out, master the sword and shield to survive in a land where every fight is a boss fight. Darkness is rising. An ancient evil has returned. Embark on a quest to restore peace, but be warned, a gauntlet of fearsome opponents stand in your way. Many have tried and failed, will you prevail?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/870a1c9b0d3a3b38d86080dde1eada2bd4c5809e/header.jpg?t=1784303303", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/87689c0a5a93c06ed7e3543cf7ffc920a2b64d46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784303303", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304800/87689c0a5a93c06ed7e3543cf7ffc920a2b64d46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784303303", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K / AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660 / Radeon HD 7850 / HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Caleb Draper"], "publishers": ["Caleb Draper"], "demos": [{"appid": 4356700, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "